2026-07-28T21:27:44.5512008Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-28T21:27:44.5652929Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-28T21:27:44.5653601Z i C:\Users\RUNNER~1\AppData\Local\Temp\RtmpM5VB50/duckdb
2026-07-28T21:27:44.5654048Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-28T21:27:44.5654436Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-28T21:27:44.5654791Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-28T21:27:44.5655329Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-28T21:27:44.5656313Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
