2026-07-28T21:41:53.8342049Z > # CRAN guard
2026-07-28T21:41:53.8342412Z > #
2026-07-28T21:41:53.8343175Z > # The duckdb test suite exercises DuckDB's bundled C++ engine, which is too heavy
